`splat fill` (crates/splat-fill) drives external fixer models; none are bundled.
Its default, NVIDIA Fixer (https://github.com/nv-tlabs/Fixer, code Apache-2.0;
weights https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Fixer under the NVIDIA Open Model
License), is Built on NVIDIA Cosmos. The optional Difix3D+ weights
(nvidia/difix_ref) are licensed for non-commercial use only. The fixer setup
(crates/splat-fill/fixer/setup_fixer.sh) applies a small patch to the Fixer
source at a pinned commit and installs stand-in modules for Transformer
Engine and Megatron Core written for this project (crates/splat-fill/fixer/shims).

